      "bullets": [
        "The POSIX shell colon builtin returns exit code 0 without spawning subprocesses, offering a lightweight alternative to external commands.",
        "Use colon parameter expansion (${VAR:=default}) to safely set default environment variables without executing secondary commands.",
        "Leverage colon for high-performance infinite loops (while :; do), instant file truncation (: > file), and syntactically required empty condition blocks."
      ]
